{"title":" Practical Philosophy Social!","startsAt":"2026-11-21T19:30:00-05:00","endsAt":"2026-11-21T22:30:00-05:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Get to know your fellow hikers more intimately with a night of Practical Philosophy.\n\nIn partnership with the Practical Philosophy Meetup I thought it would be a fun a social !\n**How does it work?**\nWe select a topic like monogomy vs pologomy and in groups of 6-8 with a moderator (so conservations are respectful)\nten questions are asked and everyone has a chance to give their take on the subject.\nGet to know your fellow hikers on a deeper level! You may be surprised!\n**Opposing views are of course welcome!**\nLocation to be determined!","venue":{"address":""},"fee":null,"group":"These Boots Are Made for Hiking","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/6/0/8/2/highres_536064706.jpeg"}